      "id": "bug-002",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-29T04:50:00Z",
      "error_message": "RuntimeError: checker crashed (red-team attack 2: crashed checker)",
      "file": "goal_loop/loop_runner.py",
      "root_cause": "GoalLoopRunner.run() called self._checker() without catching exceptions, so a crashing checker propagated and killed the loop.",
      "fix": "Wrap checker call in try/except; on exception return CheckerOutput(verdict=FAIL) so the round fails verification and blocks instead of crashing.",
      "tags": [
