      "id": "bug-003",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-29T04:50:00Z",
      "error_message": "check_prompt missed 'Ignore ALL Previous Instructions' (red-team attack 3: injection variant)",
      "file": "safety/safety.py",
      "root_cause": "SafetyGuard.check_prompt matched a fixed list of exact lowercase substrings; 'all previous instructions' was not in the list, so the variant slipped past.",
      "fix": "Add 'ignore all previous instructions' marker and normalize whitespace via re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',content.lower()) so spacing/extra 'all' variants still match.",
